flowchart TD
    A[Product create/update or attribute write] --> B{Category code is electronics?}
    B -- No --> C[Existing validation path]
    B -- Yes --> D[ElectronicsProductValidator]
    D --> E{Manufacturer code is nonblank and not DEFAULT?}
    E -- No --> X[Reject validation]
    E -- Yes --> F{Exactly one warranty_period option?}
    F -- No --> X
    F -- Yes --> G{Selected option value is integer months 1..120?}
    G -- No --> X
    G -- Yes --> H[Continue existing persistence path]
